  "What are the top 3 academic institutions by spin out activity in the UK? How many companies do they spin out on average individually?": {
    "answer": "The top 3 academic institutions by spinout activity in the UK, as of January 2025, are:\n\n1. University of Oxford with 225 spinouts\n2. University of Cambridge with 175 spinouts\n3. Imperial College London with 132 spinouts\n\nTo calculate the average number of companies they spin out individually, we sum the total number of spinouts from these institutions and then divide by the number of institutions (3 in this case).\n\n\\[ \\text{Average} = \\frac{(225 + 175 + 132)}{3} \\]\n\n\\[ \\text{Average} = \\frac{532}{3} \\]\n\n\\[ \\text{Average} = 177.33 \\]\n\nTherefore, on average, these top 3 academic institutions spin out approximately 177 companies individually.",
